                                                "example_id": "102128ed-b830-4b38-b988-ffdddb68ebf8",
                                                "sense_id": "72d8006c-86f7-34ff-bdc7-7127919e8367",
                                                "text": "A few seconds after photograph 17 was taken; note that the coated woman has stopped to chat to the group."
